    "answer": {
      "short": "Domain: $\\{1\\}$. Range: $\\{0\\}$.",
      "worked": "Both radicands must be nonnegative:\n$$\\begin{align*}x-1&\\ge0\\\\x&\\ge1\\\\1-x&\\ge0\\\\x&\\le1.\\end{align*}$$\nBoth conditions hold only when $x=1$.\n$$\\begin{align*}f(1)&=\\sqrt{1-1}+\\sqrt{1-1}\\\\f(1)&=0.\\end{align*}$$\nDomain: $\\{1\\}$. Range: $\\{0\\}$.",
